Plugin ffmpeg (copybot-plugin/copybot-plugin-ffmpeg)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

FFmpeg is not distributed with Copybot or with the plugin. When the user asks
for it, the plugin downloads a build of FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org) made by
BtbN (https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds), licensed under the GNU General
Public License (GPL) v3; the user downloads it and uses it under that licence,
whose text comes with the build. The sources of FFmpeg are on
https://ffmpeg.org.
